### 2.4 AquaScope — ACM MobiSys 2026
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

TOPIC: Generative codec-based image transmission on mobile devices.

The first acoustic-based mobile system enabling reliable image transmission
between mobile devices via generative compression (TiTok, VQGAN) in
resource-constrained environments.

Key results:
  - 40% bandwidth efficiency improvement over PNG/JPEG/neural codecs.
  - BER reduced from 19% to below 2% via token clustering and fine-tuning.
  - Works entirely on commodity smartphones — no specialized hardware.


